{"steam_appid":1718460,"steam_name":"Terminator 2D: NO FATE","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1718460/217216521/0d63ad353a12ed80e7e558b15dab26652ca7c77c/1773995952/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773996713","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257245096/7baed0ee69a4d266ea05712b49ba8f26bd26173c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773996713","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/ss_f52dae9aa8fd6f5334cd1888ab350eb9711abcbb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782137385","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/ss_b270fc9397f154b1c14a22de352ead4466ee7825.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782137385","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/ss_8c8d277afa97c892d4550aa3dcff008cfd5c717a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782137385","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/ss_5c8cffe41a6422050bf627f35396cb35805a8100.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782137385","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/ss_79c790d012d697a5fb4d830576d722d21a5d9693.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782137385"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/2ba2897c885841362fb3382c26405882.avif?t=1782137385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras_big/2ba2897c885841362fb3382c26405882.avif?t=1782137385 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the events of ‘<i>Terminator 2: Judgment Day</i>’ brought to life through glorious pixel artwork and action-packed arcade gameplay! Play as Sarah Connor and the T-800 through a variety of thrilling missions as they take on the T-1000 and try to put a stop to Skynet’s plans before the human race is annihilated. Lead the Resistance as John Connor in the future, fighting on the front lines as mankind’s only hope in the War Against the Machines. In this unique story blending iconic scenes from ‘<i>Terminator 2: Judgment Day</i>’ with original scenarios and multiple endings, humanity’s fate is yours to decide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a classic arcade experience that pays homage to the <i>Terminator 2: Judgment Day</i> universe with authentic arcade gameplay, music and pixel-perfect visuals built from the ground up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/10efb11641767fa5bac773ab214257b2.avif?t=1782137385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras_big/10efb11641767fa5bac773ab214257b2.avif?t=1782137385 width=800 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the film’s greatest action sequences and forge new paths as Sarah, John and the T-800 in a narrative featuring a mix of classic <i>Terminator 2: Judgment Day</i> scenes and untold <i>Terminator</i> stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/cc12f824ccedf6ea0b0515f2a3ea9120.poster.avif?t=1782137385\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/cc12f824ccedf6ea0b0515f2a3ea9120.webm?t=1782137385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/cc12f824ccedf6ea0b0515f2a3ea9120.mp4?t=1782137385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/61d62afb31a8567dc36b8cc6ccc85340.avif?t=1782137385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras_big/61d62afb31a8567dc36b8cc6ccc85340.avif?t=1782137385 width=800 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against the full force of Cyberdyne and Skynet’s arsenal, with multiple enemy types and adrenaline-pumping boss fights to take on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, sneak and escape the T-1000’s blades in a wide array of levels, and lead the Resistance as John Connor in critical Future War missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/23bc08184446da159266c2d21ef58dfe.poster.avif?t=1782137385\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/23bc08184446da159266c2d21ef58dfe.webm?t=1782137385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/23bc08184446da159266c2d21ef58dfe.mp4?t=1782137385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/9b291a0308505bb35ec804f465a141a7.avif?t=1782137385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras_big/9b291a0308505bb35ec804f465a141a7.avif?t=1782137385 width=800 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the highest rank in each level to reign supreme on the high score table and achieve arcade immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/f10b147e72dc33b070d5bda6e7dfb3c8.poster.avif?t=1782137385\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/f10b147e72dc33b070d5bda6e7dfb3c8.webm?t=1782137385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/f10b147e72dc33b070d5bda6e7dfb3c8.mp4?t=1782137385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/6f635f42b569cee9c8e95fef7699241f.avif?t=1782137385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras_big/6f635f42b569cee9c8e95fef7699241f.avif?t=1782137385 width=800 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a cinematic soundtrack featuring recrafted music from the legendary <i>Terminator 2: Judgment Day</i> score and all-new compositions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras/b671869bc4bc011ddd4bf47b158fc2f5.avif?t=1782137385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1718460/extras_big/b671869bc4bc011ddd4bf47b158fc2f5.avif?t=1782137385 width=800 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix things up with multiple different game modes to unlock and choose from: Story Mode, Arcade Mode, Infinite Mode, Boss Rush, Mother of the Future and Level Training!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, ARM64)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any compatible soundcard</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action"],"developers":["Bitmap Bureau"],"publishers":["Reef Entertainment"],"release_date":"12 Dec, 2025"}